.TH batten-mutate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-mutate \- Decide whether this repository\*(Aqs gates discriminate, rather than merely parse
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten mutate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decide whether this repository\*(Aqs gates discriminate, rather than merely parse
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-mutate\-sweep(1)
Apply every declared mutation to its source and report the ones its declared suite did not catch
.TP
batten\-mutate\-census(1)
Report every gate in the tree that is neither mutation\-enforced nor carrying a filed exemption
.TP
batten\-mutate\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
